    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN US ON DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SOLO OR CO-OP</h2>Dive into the immersive roguelite RPG experience of Halls of Greed where every decision shapes your fame and fortune. Halls of Greed delivers a thrilling blend of intense PvPvE combat, the hunt for rare loot, and strategic extraction mechanics that will keep you coming back for \u201cjust one more round.\u201d<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/765d255c23235e20f345e87249770b36.poster.avif?t=1724893943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/765d255c23235e20f345e87249770b36.webm?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/765d255c23235e20f345e87249770b36.mp4?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE CHARACTER CLASSES</h2>Create and upgrade characters from a diverse selection of classic fantasy archetypes, each with unique abilities and playstyles. Will you embrace the devastating spells of the mage, the discipline of the knight, the precision of the ranger, or the ferocity of the stormwarden? Each class offers a distinct approach to how you dominate the battlefield, and can be specialized to further suit your style through the Class Mastery system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/4272cf154d10ff162573c6f483257e8c.poster.avif?t=1724893943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/4272cf154d10ff162573c6f483257e8c.webm?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/4272cf154d10ff162573c6f483257e8c.mp4?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT EPIC LOOT</h2>The true measure of success lies in your ability to collect rare and powerful loot scattered throughout the crypts, castle ruins, and dungeons. Uncover legendary weapons, enchanted artifacts, and valuable resources that will enhance your abilities and secure your dominance on the battlefield.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/c0df454c79006a625fa3e232d5a6ad19.poster.avif?t=1724893943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/c0df454c79006a625fa3e232d5a6ad19.webm?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/c0df454c79006a625fa3e232d5a6ad19.mp4?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE AND EXTRACT</h2>Be sure to extract through one of the magical portals using a keystone and return to camp where you can improve your character, level up your loadout, and give yourself key advantages for the next run! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/89f12f12c64beb2d92831818dd44a1fd.poster.avif?t=1724893943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/89f12f12c64beb2d92831818dd44a1fd.webm?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/89f12f12c64beb2d92831818dd44a1fd.mp4?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERMADEATH</h2>In the high-stakes world of Halls of Greed, death is permanent - when characters die, they joins the ghosts of fallen adventurers vanquished throughout Eldoria, and leave behind the legacy of their deeds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/274b4f4551c240680a7676e9ea639ce9.poster.avif?t=1724893943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/274b4f4551c240680a7676e9ea639ce9.webm?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/274b4f4551c240680a7676e9ea639ce9.mp4?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD OF ELDORIA</h2>Halls of Greed invites you to embark on an epic adventure where danger lurks around every corner and fortune favors the bold. Are you ready to embark on an adventure and claim your place among the legends of Eldoria?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/976e580211c04b810666bcced00fc65c.poster.avif?t=1724893943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/976e580211c04b810666bcced00fc65c.webm?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/976e580211c04b810666bcced00fc65c.mp4?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SOLO OR CO-OP</h2>Dive into the immersive roguelite RPG experience of Halls of Greed where every decision shapes your fame and fortune. Halls of Greed delivers a thrilling blend of intense PvPvE combat, the hunt for rare loot, and strategic extraction mechanics that will keep you coming back for \u201cjust one more round.\u201d<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/765d255c23235e20f345e87249770b36.poster.avif?t=1724893943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/765d255c23235e20f345e87249770b36.webm?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/765d255c23235e20f345e87249770b36.mp4?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE CHARACTER CLASSES</h2>Create and upgrade characters from a diverse selection of classic fantasy archetypes, each with unique abilities and playstyles. Will you embrace the devastating spells of the mage, the discipline of the knight, the precision of the ranger, or the ferocity of the stormwarden? Each class offers a distinct approach to how you dominate the battlefield, and can be specialized to further suit your style through the Class Mastery system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/4272cf154d10ff162573c6f483257e8c.poster.avif?t=1724893943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/4272cf154d10ff162573c6f483257e8c.webm?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_