e high-stakes world of Halls of Greed, death is permanent - when characters die, they joins the ghosts of fallen adventurers vanquished throughout Eldoria, and leave behind the legacy of their deeds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/274b4f4551c240680a7676e9ea639ce9.poster.avif?t=1724893943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/274b4f4551c240680a7676e9ea639ce9.webm?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/274b4f4551c240680a7676e9ea639ce9.mp4?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD OF ELDORIA</h2>Halls of Greed invites you to embark on an epic adventure where danger lurks around every corner and fortune favors the bold. Are you ready to embark on an adventure and claim your place among the legends of Eldoria?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/976e580211c04b810666bcced00fc65c.poster.avif?t=1724893943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/976e580211c04b810666bcced00fc65c.webm?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814230/extras/976e580211c04b810666bcced00fc65c.mp4?t=1724893943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
